# Anwenden RE — known-good baseline (current)

**Status:** Current as of **2026-09-04**. Detached arm + typed-RE `--once` + next-case Fall skip + sounds.

## Operator inputs only

**Chat:** **login**, **RE** (first case only), **PR**, **DONE**. Never ask for **NEXT** / case-2+ **RE** / **LF**.

## Close-out (do not mix) — prefer `--closeout-*` (background + notify)

| Trigger | Meaning | Closeout | Operator click |
|---------|---------|----------|----------------|
| **PR** (EMAIL non-transfer) | **`--closeout-anwenden`** | Anwenden |
| **Auto-LF** (**CALL**) | **`--closeout-next`** | exact Next |
| **Auto-LF TR** (queue) | **`--closeout-weiter`** | Transfer UI → Weiter |
| **Auto-LF TR** (email) | **`--closeout-extern`** | Externer Transfer → Weiterleiten |

On notify / stop-hook `[AUTO_PIPELINE]`: immediate 7-step + Auto-LF. Prowler ≠ stop.

**Senden is NOT an arming criterion** — independent of Anwenden. Operator clicks either in any order. Agent never says "Senden, then Anwenden".

**CALL Next arm:** exact label **Next** on `button[data-tracker-event-id="@guidedWorkflow/runner/screenButton"]` only (not Back / Weiter / Weiterleiten). Detection is **DOM/event-based** (not pixel coordinates) — disposition tray position does not matter. Close DevTools **Inspect** before clicking (Inspect steals the click). If a live `--arm-next` watch was started before a detection fix, **kill/re-arm** so the new listener code loads.

## Auto RE vs typed RE vs arm

| Action | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| **New EMAIL case** (login / `--await-arm` extract) | Agent **auto** extract → 7-step + **Auto-LF**. Operator does **not** type **RE**. |
| Typed **RE** / bare `run.py` | **Recovery `--once` only** — re-read visible case. **Never** arm Anwenden. |
| After **PR** (non-transfer) | Explicit `--arm` then await → next case **auto** 7-step + Auto-LF (no RE) |
| After transfer / CALL Auto-LF | `--arm-weiter` / `--arm-extern` / `--arm-next` then await |

## Detached arm + click-ready

1. `run.py --arm*` → **`ARM_WATCH_DETACHED`** + **`READY_FOR_YOUR_CLICK`** + **Dexter** (no console window: `CREATE_NO_WINDOW`).
2. Chat: `Armed — click … now.` + finishing quote (`PR done` / `LF done` / `LF TR done`).
3. `run.py --await-arm` (user may already click; await spinner ≠ “not ready”).
4. Full **7-step RE** + `--play-ready` + **Auto-LF**, then transfer arm or wait for **PR**.

If `--await-arm` aborted → **re-run `--await-arm`**. If log has `ERROR: NEXT CASE NOT OPEN` → **`run.py --once`**. Never stack a second arm while one wait is live.

**Click-ready = Dexter + READY_FOR_YOUR_CLICK** — not “await finished.”

## Next-case open (post Anwenden / Weiter / Weiterleiten)

1. Remember **closed Fall #** while case still open.
2. **Sidetray poll** (no fixed delay): from arm trigger, poll `[data-entityid="CollapsedPreviewsList"]` every ~0.25s until a new `collapsed-case-item` appears whose aria-label is **not** that Fall # (timeout ~30s). Stdout: `SIDETRAY_WATCH_ARMED`, optional `SIDETRAY_EMPTY`, then `SIDETRAY_CHANNEL: CALL|EMAIL|UNKNOWN`.
3. **EMAIL** sidetray → **click** item (`CASE_ITEM_AUTO_CLICKED` → **`SIDETRAY_EMAIL_PROCESSING_IMMEDIATE`**) → script **immediately** extract in same chain. Agent **immediately** 7-step + Auto-LF when extract stdout ready — no operator RE. **CALL** sidetray → **do not click**; wait for overlay auto-open (`SIDETRAY_CALL_SKIP_CLICK` → `SIDETRAY_CALL_AUTO_OPEN`). Monitoring runs for both.
4. Retry if still console / same Fall; on hard fail → stop arm + `ERROR: NEXT CASE NOT OPEN — run run.py --once` (do **not** wait for another Weiterleiten).

**CALL sidetray icon:** `svg[data-icon-name="BrandVoiceCircleClr"]` (green voice badge). Example Fall **#57938822**.  
**EMAIL sidetray icon:** `svg[data-icon-name="BrandEmailCircleClr"]` (blue envelope badge). Example Fall **#57675993** — click to open.

**Weiter:** exact **Weiter** only (ignore Weiterleiten / Weiteleiten).  
**Extern:** exact **Weiterleiten** only (ignore Externer Transfer).  
**Prowler:** extract DONE — agent continues via closeout notify or stop-hook `[AUTO_PIPELINE]`. **Forbidden:** idle after sound; asking operator for NEXT/RE/LF.

## Workday flow

1. **login** → agent **auto `--once`** on first visible case (no typed **RE**) → **CHANNEL: CALL|EMAIL** (do **not** arm call_listen while STT parked)
2. **EMAIL** → agent **auto** 7-step → `--play-ready` → **Auto-LF** → operator **PR** (non-transfer) or transfer arm (no PR)
3. **CALL** → CHANNEL detect → **Auto-LF** voice immediately → **`--arm-next`** (BRIEF optional)
4. Close-out arm + await → next case → Auto-LF again
5. **DONE** at end of day

## Hard constraints

- `leave_page_unchanged` on Anwenden RE connect
- Detached arms; no `DETACHED_PROCESS` console pop
- No `monitor_emails` / `get_new_emails` fallback for RE modes
- No focus steal while waiting

